{
    "background_story": "Andi was a free-spirited surfer who lived for the thrill of riding the waves. Growing up in California, she spent most of her days soaking up the sun and chasing the ultimate tubular experience. Andi's passion for surfing took her to the most iconic beaches around the world, from Pipeline to Uluwatu. Her fearless attitude and quick reflexes made her a standout in the surf community. When she wasn't competing in tournaments, Andi spent her time teaching underprivileged kids how to catch their first waves. Her infectious enthusiasm and love for the ocean inspired a new generation of surfers. Andi's life was a testament to the power of following your dreams and staying true to your stoke.",
